    "notes": "Autonomous review of all original chronological frames, enlarged hand/weapon/foot details and all 256 native 128px-reference phase poses. Reciprocal root-foot walk; stable two-handed living crossbow; near right fist windup/strike/regrip with matched segment joins; loaded aim/release/recovery timed to contact; physical raised-fist support without a shot; dedicated braced guard; recoil with original shed leaves; continuous grounded collapse and persistent final corpse. Original eight-frame articulated idle reviewed and retained exactly, including map strip. No visible plate residue or clipped antlers/weapon at native scale. Retiming trims source holds while keeping rapid transitions consecutive; ranged sources32-37 containing the outgoing bolt are excluded at a coherent held-body boundary because the game owns the projectile. No continuous-video playback, manual game session, full suite or Linux test claimed."
